  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a scalar.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>108</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math> and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>36</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p>",
